/* STM32G474 TIM1 Channel 1 (PA8) PWM Configuration
 * System Clock: 170 MHz (all APB prescalers = 1)
 * PWM Target Frequency: 20 kHz
 * PWM Target Duty Cycle: 25 %
 */

